            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "First Dalton, now Shelly... What's going on here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "I said, Shelly is dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "What's with that tone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "Anyway, thanks for coming to inform us that another accident occurred. We're shocked too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "The last person she met before she died was Michael."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "Don't make baseless accusations, Tip."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "She was watching movies with you and Moira. I heard all about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Exactly. She was with us, but left partway through after she got a message. Molly and I didn't ask, and we didn't go with her. But maybe we should have..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Which is why we need to find out exactly what happened. So I asked around, and\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Someone saw her with you at the studio near the warehouse!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I just bumped into her!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "She looked distracted. I thought she must've been feeling guilty about interrupting the shoot, so I offered to comfort her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "How was I supposed to know she would take her own life?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "<i>Comfort</i> her? In an empty studio? Just the two of you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Come on, babe, you know you're the only girl for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "Just shut up already!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "So did you really kill Shelly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
