        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$mist_intro",
            "key": "$mist_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Are you kidding me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I killed Shelly just because she rejected me? Babe, do you even hear what you're saying?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Tip, you said she left because she got a message, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I noticed her holding her terminal too. So whoever sent that message must've killed her, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "And you're saying it wasn't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Marion",
        "text": "I'd also like an explanation, Michael."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "The terminal was damaged by the cold, making it impossible to retrieve the logs, but everyone on the film crew was given the same company-issued model. There shouldn't be anyone but crew members on the contact list..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "And what's that supposed to prove, <i>Detective</i>?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "It could just as well be Greta, or Melanie."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "They sure weren't happy with how she interrupted the shooting that day. Maybe one of them decided to give her a piece of her mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Shelly and Greta are glued at the hip when working, giving them plenty of opportunities to deal with anything unexpected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "And Melanie is a stickler for the rules and etiquette of the industry. She always respects the crew's schedule and would never disturb a coworker when they're off the clock."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "The only clue we have is that she was with you right before she died."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Look, I don't know who sent her that message either, okay? I just ran into her at the studio!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "At that hour, wouldn't you normally be drinking with the girls from the art team, or in Marion's room?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Aren't you usually <i>busiest</i> at night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "So why did you go back to the filming area, Michael?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Oh, my lovely little birdie, are you jealous that you haven't had the chance to drink with me yet?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Well, you'll have plenty of chances once you grow up\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "So you came to the studio for whatever unknown reason, where you ran into Shelly, who had left the prop room to meet someone else. If all you did was offer a few words of comfort, why won't you give me a straight answer?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Did you really have nothing to do with her death?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "What, after working every stupid little oddjob in Wrankwood, from cleaner to stagehand to set decorator to background painter, now you're playing at being a detective?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Or did Shelly become an honorary member of your little sisterhood with Moira after watching a single horror flick together?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "Give me a break."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "How many times has she yelled at you for those scribbles you call work? You're hardly friends. I don't see why you're coming after me now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "And you think there's a culprit behind every accident? Maybe all those movies have rotted your brain!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "...In the two months I've known Shelly, she's almost never smiled or praised anyone's work."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Sure, I got more criticism than anyone. I've had to put in a ton of overtime to make a background we were both happy with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "But I've also seen the joy on her face when she was checking the film at the end of each day. And she could catch all the obscure movie references I snuck into my backgrounds."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "If... she was in so much pain that freeing herself of it like this seemed like the best option, then I'll just have to accept that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "But if someone else was messing with her feelings, and taking away her chance to enjoy the movies she loved so much... then I'll never forgive them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I really did run into Shelly by chance. I went to the studio to... see someone."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "See someone? Can anyone corroborate that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Michael",
        "text": "I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "It was me."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Molly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Michael came to see me last night."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_warehouse",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Were you close to her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "I simply empathized with her pain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "She needed to stay lucid. So did I."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "(Mutters) Hm, a mysterious curse, or a love turned to hate... Which would sell better?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Ahem. So, where were <i>you</i> last night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "The second-floor office."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "That's where Shelly and Greta keep their important documents. What were you doing there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Solving a puzzle."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Anyone see you there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Miss.Christine."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Hah, I'm supposed to take the word of that creature who's always following you around? She doesn't even talk!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Come on, don't look so pissed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "I saw you perform opposite Dalton the other day. I know how good an actor you are. You could tell me anything and it'd sound believable."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "But to tell you the truth, I don't even care how Shelly died. And I wouldn't tell the police even if you were involved."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Heck, getting your name in the tabloids might even make the cops <i>less</i> suspicious. Tons of people read them, but no one believes a word they say."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "So, how about you cooperate a little\u2014what's this puzzle you were solving in the office? Trying to set a trap for Shelly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "You're not worried that a murder occurred on the plate?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Hey, this film crew's got no shortage of grudges and scores to settle... And how else am I supposed to make a living? You think there's any money in being a camera assistant?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Even if the answer might threaten everyone's lives?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Hah! You sure can talk big."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lucian",
        "text": "Then I must ask you to keep this a secret..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "Of course! The tabloids will pay good money for it, so why would I give away my own golden ticket?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian leans towards the camera assistant and whispers the hidden truth in his ear."
    },
    {
        "text": "The look in the assistant's eyes turns from excitement to terror."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.2,
            "xstrength": 20,
            "ystrength": 20,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_pendrop"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "The Forte's scream echoes through the warehouse. His notebook and pen fall to the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "The other staff, still cleaning up the scene, look at the two of them disapprovingly. But only for a moment, until the terrifying message reaches their ears."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.4,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant",
        "text": "A Catastrophe is about to hit the plate?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
